# Nimbus

Menu-bar clipboard manager (macOS 14+, Apple Silicon). Not a regular document app.

Before non-trivial changes, read **AGENTS.md** (conventions, traps) and **README.md** (architecture).

Write **docs and code comments in English**.

## Quick constraints

- Core logic → `Packages/NimbusCore`; UI/wiring → `Nimbus/`
- Settings = system `Settings` scene (separate window), never embed in history panel
- Images always copied into Application Support; never rely on temp/Desktop paths
- Screenshot folder from `com.apple.screencapture` location
- No `CGWindowListCreateImage` unless `CGPreflightScreenCaptureAccess()`
- Languages in picker: system, en, uk, es, pl, cs, sk, hu, de, fr — full L10n tables today: **en** + **uk** (others fall back to en)
- New UI strings: update `L10n` en + uk at minimum
- Tests: `cd Packages/NimbusCore && swift test` with isolated `ClipboardStore(rootURL:)`
- Reply to the project owner in Ukrainian unless they ask otherwise
